      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "•Coonan Property present this superb A2-rated, four-bedroom detached residence, set within the exclusive and recently completed Williams Grove development\n•Extending to approx. 2,003 sq.ft., this beautifully appointed home offers bright and generous accommodation comprising an impressive entrance hallway, elegant living room, separate TV/playroom, contemporary open-plan kitchen and dining area, utility room, four double bedrooms (two en suite), family bathroom and attic with folding ladder access\n•Boasting an impressive A2 BER rating, complemented by an energy-efficient air-to-water heat pump heating system and high levels of insulation\n•Thoughtfully designed with versatility in mind, offering adaptable living spaces suitable for a playroom, home office, gym or guest accommodation\n•Presented in turnkey condition with exceptional finishes throughout, including a bespoke contemporary kitchen with feature island and quartz worktops, elegantly tiled bathrooms, wood-panelled walls, high-quality flooring and custom cabinetry\n•Enjoys an enviable position overlooking a beautifully maintained green area, providing an attractive setting particularly suited to families with young children\n•Within walking distance of the highly regarded St. Anne`s Primary School, local shop, GAA club, coffee shop, scenic Royal Canal walkway and Lyons Estate\n•Excellent sporting and leisure amenities are within easy reach, including world-class golf at The K Club and Carton House, together with horse racing at Punchestown, Naas and The Curragh\n•Ideally situated in the picturesque village of Ardclough, approximately 30 minutes from Dublin, with excellent connectivity via Hazelhatch Train Station (5km) and the nearby M7 (6km) and M4 (12km) motorways\n\nGuide Price\n870,000\n\nType of Transaction\nPrivate Treaty\n\nAccommodation:\n\nEntrance Driveway\nCobble lock driveway, two side gates, outdoor light and mature hedging surround . \n\nEntrance Hallway (Including Guest W.C) 3.5m x 4.5m \nLaminate flooring, wood panelled walls, hanging pendant light with shade and thermostat. \n\nGuest W.C. 1.4m x 1.6m\nTiled flooring, hanging pendant light, w.c., w.h.b. with vanity unit and shaving light, window and a wood panelled wall. \n\nLiving Room 7.8m x 6.3m\nLaminate flooring, hanging pendant light with shade, venetian blinds, curtains, semi panelled walls, TV point and door leading to rear garden. \n \nTV/Playroom 4.7m x 2.7m \nLaminate flooring, hanging pendant light with shade, curtains, thermostat and double pocket doors leading to kitchen/dining. \n\nKitchen/Dining Area 6.7m x 4.6m\nLaminate flooring, hanging pendant light withs shade, roman blinds, shaker style floor to wall cabinets with bronze handles, Franke stainless steel sink, integrated Neff oven, Neff microwave, Neff fridge, Neff freezer, Neff dishwasher, Neff hob, extractor fan, granite counter tops, breakfast bar with additional cabinets and sockets.\n\nUtility Room 2.3m x 2.7m \nLaminate flooring, hanging pendant light with shade, fully plumbed with Bosch washing machine and dryer, counter top, Franke stainless steel sink, shaker style floor to wall cabinets, additional storage and door leading to rear garden. \n\nLanding 4m x 4.6m\nCarpet flooring from stairway to landing, venetian blinds, wood panelled walls, additional storage space with hanging pendant light, access to attic space via fitted ladder and a hanging pendant light with shade. \n\nMaster Bedroom 3.8m x 4.2m\nCarpet flooring, hanging pedant light with shade, access to attic space, curtains and a thermostat.\n\nWalk-in Wardrobe 2.1m x 1.7m\nCarpet flooring, hanging pendant light, fitted wardrobes and additional sockets. \n\nEnsuite 2.3m x 1.9m\nTiled flooring, light fitting, w.c., w.h.b. with tiled splashback, window, fitted heated vertical towel rail and wet room shower area. \n\nBedroom 2 2.9m x 3.5m\nCarpet flooring, hanging pendant light with shade, curtains and fitted wardrobe. \n \nBedroom 3 3.8m x 3.4m\nCarpet flooring, hanging pendant light with shade, roman blinds and fitted wardrobe.\n\nEnsuite 2.6m x 1.2m\nTiled flooring, light fitting, w.c., w.h.b. with tiled splashback, heated vertical towel rail, wet room shower area.\n\nBedroom 4 3.3m x 4.3m\nCarpet flooring, hanging pendant light with shade, curtains and fitted wardrobe. \n\nFamily Bathroom 2.4m x 3.6m\nTiled flooring, light fitting, w.c., w.h.b. with tiled splashback, bathtub with tiled surround and shower screen, window, venetian blinds and heated vertical towel rail. \n\nGarden\nGranite patio, lawn area, outdoor sockets, outdoor light and outdoor tap. \n\nAdditional Information:\nGross internal floor area approx. 186 sq.m or 2,002 sq.ft\nConvertible attic space with flooring and light fitting\nAttic suitable for conversion\nOutside lights, sockets and tap\nConcrete block construction \nUPVC A rated double glazed windows\nSmoke, heat and CO2 detectors fitted throughout the property\nVery high levels of insulation incorporated in floors, walls and roofs\nFull mechanical ventilation with heat recovery (MHRV)\nElegant high-quality fitted kitchens and wardrobes\nFitted storage units to utility room\nWired for high speed broadband (Cat 6)\n\nItems Included in sale:\nAll fitted appliances, light fittings, curtains and blinds (furniture negotiable).\n\nServices\nMains water \nAir to water heat pump \n\nBER \nA2\n\nViewing\nBy appointment only.\n\nEircode: W23 R91V\n\nContact Information\nSales Person \nMick Wright\n01 6288400\n\n\n \n"
